    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Randomly generated 3D dungeon</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753830/extras/df7604648afddf170b25e309372f8f87.avif?t=1705936073\" width=480 height=270 /></span>.<br>Dive into a 10-layer dungeon called the Lost Forest and reach the goal on each level!<br>The dungeons are randomly generated each time you dive, so you have to carefully map your way through them.<br>The game is played with one movement and one attack per turn. When you move one step, the enemy moves one step.<br>If you get wiped out, you lose all items you picked up, so be careful!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character customization</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753830/extras/3cfa9aa3a05edf5880352df5f8582cc7.avif?t=1705936073\" width=480 height=270 /></span>.<br>The player character is entirely up to you, including name, appearance and stats.<br>You can take up to five of them with you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hack-and-Slash</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753830/extras/2159df749db4a7a12ba54cf4116aad41.avif?t=1705936073\" width=480 height=270 /></span>.<br>Sorry, this game has only a few conversations and no storyline.<br>I want you to stoically level up, collect items and reach the goal.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Randomly generated 3D dungeon</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753830/extras/df7604648afddf170b25e309372f8f87.avif?t=1705936073\" width=480 height=270 /></span>.<br>Dive into a 10-layer dungeon called the Lost Forest and reach the goal on each level!<br>The dungeons are randomly generated each time you dive, so you have to carefully map your way through them.<br>The game is played with one movement and one attack per turn. When you move one step, the enemy moves one step.<br>If you get wiped out, you lose all items you picked up, so be careful!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character customization</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753830/extras/3cfa9aa3a05edf5880352df5f8582cc7.avif?t=1705936073\" width=480 height=270 /></span>.<br>The player character is entirely up to you, including name, appearance and stats.<br>You can take up to five of them with you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hack-and-Slash</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753830/extras/2159df749db4a7a12ba54cf4116aad41.avif?t=1705936073\" width=480 height=270 /></span>.<br>Sorry, this game has only a few conversations and no storyline.<br>I want you to stoically level up, collect items and reach the goal.",
    "short_description": "A roguelike RPG in which you explore a randomly generated 3D dungeon, collecting items and aiming for the goal of each level. You are free to choose your character's name, looks, stats, etc. Use more than 50 skills and over 200 items to completely conquer the 10 layers of the Lost Forest.",
